From 9deabe7986677489cb7e13b96bbc784832769742 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tarpediem <tarpediem@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:34:04 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] drm/panel: add Samsung S6TUUM3 AMSA24VU01 panel driver

2800x1752 OLED panel of the Galaxy Tab S7+ (gts7xl): S6TUUM3 DDIC with
an Anapass TCON, four DSI lanes, command mode, DSC 1.1 with two 1400x12
slices. Command bytes, waits and the power sequence (vddlcd, LP-11,
reset, wait for TCON_RDY) follow the vendor kernel. Normal brightness
range only, through the vendor DBV table.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
